.TH log-bill 1  "log-bill 1.0.0" 
.SH NAME
log\-bill \- Offline estimate of log costs per pattern
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlog\-bill\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-message\-field\fR] [\fB\-\-group\-by\fR] [\fB\-\-window\fR] [\fB\-\-days\-per\-month\fR] [\fB\-\-prices\fR] [\fB\-\-rules\fR] [\fB\-\-top\fR] [\fB\-\-explain\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-budget\-month\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-new\-share\fR] [\fB\-\-retention\fR] [\fB\-\-billing\fR] [\fB\-\-indexed\-price\fR] [\fB\-\-index\-rules\fR] [\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Offline estimate of log costs per pattern
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: text]
Input format: text or jsonl
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
text
.IP \(bu 2
jsonl
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-message\-field\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
JSON field that holds the message
.TP
\fB\-\-group\-by\fR \fI<FIELD>\fR
Group costs per source: the value of this JSON field (scan, jsonl)
.TP
\fB\-\-window\fR \fI<WINDOW>\fR
Time window of the sample, for example 15m
.TP
\fB\-\-days\-per\-month\fR \fI<DAYS>\fR [default: 30]
Days in a month for the extrapolation
.TP
\fB\-\-prices\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Price file (JSON)
.TP
\fB\-\-rules\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
File with drop and sample rules
.TP
\fB\-\-top\fR \fI<N>\fR
Show the N largest patterns; the rest as other
.TP
\fB\-\-explain\fR
Show the masks and the calculation per pattern
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Write JSON instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-budget\-month\fR \fI<AMOUNT>\fR
Monthly budget; exit with code 1 if the estimate is above it
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-new\-share\fR \fI<PCT>\fR
Maximum share of new patterns, in percent
.TP
\fB\-\-retention\fR \fI<DAYS>\fR
Indexed\-log retention in days: 3, 7, 15 or 30
.TP
\fB\-\-billing\fR \fI<PLAN>\fR
Indexed\-log billing plan: annual, monthly or ondemand
.TP
\fB\-\-indexed\-price\fR \fI<USD>\fR
Indexed\-log price in USD per 1M events. Overrides the list price
.TP
\fB\-\-index\-rules\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Index exclusion rules (drop and sample), applied after \-\-rules
.TP
\fB\-\-quiet\fR
Hide the hint line. No context line
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print the hint line, and on success one context line on stderr
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Write the report to this file instead of stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
log\-bill\-scan(1)
Group a log file into patterns
.TP
log\-bill\-diff(1)
Compare two samples
.TP
log\-bill\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v1.0.0
